                                                "example_id": "4f9c9505-7834-47e6-9539-799e3b5e12b4",
                                                "sense_id": "f8a25dec-6a00-3842-8b21-729715ffa942",
                                                "text": "[…] thalia is a lesbian that dated a trans girl once and got a taste of gridlock and now is exclusively a chaser for trans girls"
